:HELP NAME=VFYTCPCNN.Verify TCP/IP Connection (VFYTCPCNN)
:P.Use the Verify TCP/IP Connection (VFYTCPCNN) command to PING under
its other name.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='VFYTCPCNN/RMTSYS'.Remote system (RMTSYS)
:P.The remote system, by host name or internet address.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
